      "nonstandard_elements": "Two related experiences: (1) prior clinical hypnosis visit to 'the light' with spirit guide and instruction to return to 'work'; (2) later cardiac arrest NDE in a dark in-between tunnel/void with shadowy beings and an unseen higher presence. During NDE she was 'made to feel the pain' her family would feel; shown an image of her young niece as persuasion to return; described prolonged post-return dissociation ('walking dead', between worlds).",
